        <mxCell id="contract" value="&lt;b&gt;核心 DTO 约束&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXECUTION_RESULT&lt;/b&gt;: execution_decision, actual_goal?, output, acceptance_result?　|　&lt;b&gt;PLAN_RESULT&lt;/b&gt;: gaps, next_task_spec?　|　&lt;b&gt;DISPATCH_RESULT&lt;/b&gt;: outcome, driver_bot_id?, next_relay_bots?, collab_mode?, miss_reason?&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;统一 envelope&lt;/b&gt;: task_id, node_id, event_type, event_id, holder_id, relay_turn?, progress_reason?, failure_reason?, payload　|　SEARCH_RESULT 仅兼容旧名并归一为 DISPATCH_RESULT&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#16324F;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=15;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
